<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfolio | The Matrix x Star Wars</title>
    <style>
        /* === RESET & FONTS === */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #000;
            color: #00ff41;
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* === CANVAS MATRIX === */
        #matrixCanvas {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
            z-index: -2;
        }

        /* === EFFET ECRAN DYNAMIQUE (CRT) === */
        .crt-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
            z-index: -1;
            pointer-events: none;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,0,0,0) 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 100%),
                linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 50%);
            background-size: 100% 100%, 100% 4px;
            animation: flicker 0.15s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes flicker {
            0% { opacity: 0.95; }
            50% { opacity: 1; }
            100% { opacity: 0.98; }
        }

        /* === CONTENEUR PRINCIPAL & ONGLETS === */
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 40px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            background-color: rgba(0, 10, 0, 0.7);
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 65, 0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
            min-height: 80vh;
        }

        .tab-content {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-in-out;
        }

        .tab-content.active {
            display: block;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        /* === TYPOGRAPHIE === */
        h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: normal; text-transform: uppercase; }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00ff41;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #ccc;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* === SABRES LASER === */
        .lightsaber {
            height: 4px; width: 100%;
            margin: 30px 0; background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 4px; position: relative;
        }
        .saber-blue { box-shadow: 0 0 10px #0077ff, 0 0 20px #0077ff, 0 0 30px #0077ff; }
        .saber-red { box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff0000, 0 0 20px #ff0000, 0 0 30px #ff0000; }
        .saber-green { box-shadow: 0 0 10px #00ff41, 0 0 20px #00ff41, 0 0 30px #00ff41; }

        .lightsaber::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute;
            left: 0; top: -3px; height: 10px; width: 50px;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #444, #888, #444);
            border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid #222;
        }

        /* === BOITES TERMINAL === */
        .terminal-box {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid #005f0b;
            padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-left: 5px solid #00ff41;
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }
        .terminal-box:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 119, 255, 0.2);
            border-left: 5px solid #0077ff; 
            background-color: rgba(0, 20, 40, 0.4);
        }
        .terminal-box h3 {
            color: #fff; margin-bottom: 15px; display: inline-block;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #00ff41;
        }

        ul { list-style-type: square; padding-left: 20px; }
        li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .highlight { color: #fff; font-weight: bold; }

        /* === BOUTONS DE NAVIGATION === */
        .btn-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .matrix-btn {
            background-color: #000;
            color: #00ff41;
            border: 2px solid #00ff41;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 65, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .matrix-btn:hover {
            background-color: #00ff41;
            color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 255, 65, 0.8);
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .btn-return-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        /* Effet curseur */
        .cursor {
            display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 1.2rem;
            background-color: #00ff41; animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        @keyframes blink { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <canvas id="matrixCanvas"></canvas>
    <div class="crt-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container">
        
        <!-- ONGLET 1 : ACCUEIL -->
        <div id="tab-home" class="tab-content active">
            <header>
                <h1>> Wake up, Padawan...<span class="cursor"></span></h1>
                <h2>Technicien Support Informatique | Alternant BTS SIO</h2>
            </header>

            <div class="lightsaber saber-blue"></div>

            <section class="terminal-box">
                <h3>> ./A_PROPOS.exe</h3>
                <p>
                    Anciennement dans le secteur de la santé, j'ai choisi la pilule rouge pour basculer dans l'infrastructure IT. <br><br>
                    Actuellement en formation au <span class="highlight">CCI Campus Mulhouse</span>, je combine rigueur analytique et résolution de problèmes techniques au quotidien.
                </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Menu de navigation principal -->
            <div class="btn-container">
                <button class="matrix-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab-project')">>_ PROJET</button>
                <button class="matrix-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab-skills')">>_ COMPÉTENCES</button>
                <button class="matrix-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab-experiences')">>_ EXPÉRIENCES</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ONGLET 2 : PROJET TELEPHONIE -->
        <div id="tab-project" class="tab-content">
            <header>
                <h1>> Projet_Telephonie.sh<span class="cursor"></span></h1>
                <h2>Renouvellement du parc téléphonique de la structure</h2>
            </header>

            <div class="lightsaber saber-green"></div>

            <section class="terminal-box">
